  entry #face
    info
        - the typeface's regular, upright face, from which the others are chosen
        + le style droit normal de la famille, à partir duquel les autres sont choisis
    detail
        - A `Face of Topic` at `Weight.Regular`, `Slant.Upright` and `Stretch.Normal`, with no
        - variations and no features, whose type records `Weights = 400`, `Slanting = "upright"`
        - and `Enabled = Nothing`. `#regular` is the same face.
        + Un `Face of Topic` en `Weight.Regular`, `Slant.Upright` et `Stretch.Normal`, sans
        + variations ni fonctionnalités, dont le type enregistre `Weights = 400`,
        + `Slanting = "upright"` et `Enabled = Nothing`. `#regular` est le même style.
